WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.671 --> 00:00:16.353
After washing, Mandy put on clothes Rima gave her.

2
00:00:17.474 --> 00:00:21.577
She wore loose pants and a shirt that almost came to her knees.

3
00:00:22.758 --> 00:00:25.079
Vinnie also dressed in a long shirt.

4
00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:29.922
But he wore a skirt that went all the way to his ankles!

5
00:00:29.942 --> 00:00:34.009
"Time to eat," Rishi's father announced.

6
00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:37.531
The family gathered around the stove.

7
00:00:38.752 --> 00:00:40.553
Vinnie and Mandy joined them.

8
00:00:41.913 --> 00:00:46.176
Rishi's family closed their eyes and began to chant quietly.

9
00:00:47.296 --> 00:00:48.897
They put their hands together.

10
00:00:50.138 --> 00:00:53.720
Then, the family threw rice grains into the fire.

11
00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:58.463
"They're praying," whispered Mandy to Vinnie.

12
00:00:59.643 --> 00:01:02.957
After the prayer, Rishi brought out a bowl of water.

13
00:01:04.158 --> 00:01:08.220
He and Rima sat beside their father and washed his feet.

14
00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:13.423
"I guess this is a sign of respect," whispered Vinnie.

15
00:01:13.443 --> 00:01:19.086
"Maybe we should wash Dad's feet too," he joked.

16
00:01:20.427 --> 00:01:21.428
Mandy giggled.

17
00:01:24.049 --> 00:01:25.890
Finally, the food was served.

18
00:01:27.011 --> 00:01:30.740
Rishi's father sat on a mat, cross-legged on the floor.

19
00:01:31.861 --> 00:01:35.362
His wife put rice onto a large banana leaf for him.

20
00:01:35.382 --> 00:01:39.203
"Does your mother always serve your father food?"

21
00:01:39.723 --> 00:01:41.064
Vinnie asked Rishi.

22
00:01:41.084 --> 00:01:44.465
"Of course," he replied.

23
00:01:44.485 --> 00:01:46.685
"It is our custom.

24
00:01:47.286 --> 00:01:49.086
Now we must serve our mother."

25
00:01:50.286 --> 00:01:55.068
The children washed their hands, and their mother sat beside their father.

26
00:01:56.304 --> 00:01:59.566
Then Rishi and Rima served rice to their mother.

27
00:01:59.586 --> 00:02:04.228
"Children eat last," said Rishi.

28
00:02:05.229 --> 00:02:09.151
He gave rice to Vinnie and Mandy and they sat on a mat.

29
00:02:10.272 --> 00:02:11.652
"How do I eat this?"

30
00:02:12.253 --> 00:02:13.053
Mandy asked.

31
00:02:14.194 --> 00:02:15.935
She had no spoon or fork.

32
00:02:15.955 --> 00:02:21.838
"Like this," said Rima, picking up the rice with her hand.

33
00:02:23.319 --> 00:02:28.769
Vinnie and Mandy tried to copy her, but most of the rice ended up on the floor.

34
00:02:29.769 --> 00:02:30.769
Everyone laughed.

35
00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:39.152
Then, without warning, a large cow walked right into the porch!

36
00:02:39.172 --> 00:02:43.653
"Hey!" cried Mandy.

37
00:02:44.633 --> 00:02:47.614
She dropped her rice and hid behind her brother.

38
00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:49.295
"Get away!

39
00:02:49.615 --> 00:02:53.536
Move!" Vinnie got up and waved his arms at the cow.

40
00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:57.803
The cow looked at him with big, bored eyes.

41
00:02:57.823 --> 00:03:02.426
"You mustn't Rishi cried.

42
00:03:03.627 --> 00:03:07.310
Vinnie slapped the cow's back, and it mooed loudly.

43
00:03:08.251 --> 00:03:12.034
Mandy wondered why Rishi's family wasn't doing anything.

44
00:03:12.054 --> 00:03:14.576
"Get away!

45
00:03:14.916 --> 00:03:20.181
Shoo!" Vinnie grabbed a stick lying against the wall and poked the cow.

46
00:03:21.322 --> 00:03:23.944
Suddenly, a man ran into the porch.

47
00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:27.162
He saw Vinnie poke the animal.

48
00:03:27.182 --> 00:03:30.164
"What are you doing to my cow?"

49
00:03:30.604 --> 00:03:31.324
he shouted.

50
00:03:31.344 --> 00:03:37.729
"Please, Babu Yadav," Rishi's father said, trying to calm the man.

51
00:03:38.829 --> 00:03:40.731
Rishi grabbed the stick from Vinnie.

52
00:03:40.751 --> 00:03:43.873
"Stop!" cried Rishi.

53
00:03:43.893 --> 00:03:46.094
"What's the matter?"

54
00:03:46.715 --> 00:03:47.355
asked Vinnie.

55
00:03:47.375 --> 00:03:49.397
"That boy!

56
00:03:49.617 --> 00:03:50.577
He hit my cow!

57
00:03:50.898 --> 00:03:51.898
I'm telling the king!"

58
00:03:52.599 --> 00:03:54.100
Babu Yadav shouted.

59
00:03:55.456 --> 00:03:56.797
"What is he talking about?"

60
00:03:57.457 --> 00:03:58.938
asked Vinnie, confused.

61
00:04:00.338 --> 00:04:03.019
"Vinnie! Cows are sacred animals.

62
00:04:03.459 --> 00:04:06.761
We never treat them badly," said Rishi.

63
00:04:06.781 --> 00:04:10.943
"Even if they come into your house?"

64
00:04:11.603 --> 00:04:12.303
asked Vinnie.

65
00:04:12.323 --> 00:04:18.686
"There is great punishment for those who harm cows," Rishi said seriously.

66
00:04:18.706 --> 00:04:21.567
"The king will hear about this!"

67
00:04:22.447 --> 00:04:23.768
Babu Yadav cried.
